    <section v-if="!workspace && !designMode" class="home">
      <div class="home-heading"><span class="eyebrow">INQUIRY STUDIO · 教师工作台</span><h1>让每一节课，都更值得探索</h1><p>从教学设计到教案优化，让专业教学知识支持你的课堂。</p></div>
      <div class="entry-grid"><article class="entry-card"><div class="entry-icon"><BookOpenCheck :size="25" /></div><div class="entry-copy"><span class="entry-kicker">DESIGN</span><h2>教学设计</h2><p>从教学想法开始，生成适合课堂的探究式教学方案。</p></div><button class="entry-link" @click="showDesign">进入教学设计 <ArrowRight :size="17" /></button></article><article class="entry-card"><div class="entry-icon"><FileSearch :size="25" /></div><div class="entry-copy"><span class="entry-kicker">REVIEW</span><h2>教案分析</h2><p>导入已有教案，编辑并保存版本，获得教学助手建议。</p></div><button class="entry-link" @click="openLessonImport">导入教案 <ArrowRight :size="17" /></button></article></div>
      <section class="recent-work" aria-labelledby="recent-work-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR WORK</span><h2 id="recent-work-title">最近的工作</h2><p>继续上次的教学设计与教案编辑。</p></div><button v-if="history.length > 5" class="link" @click="showHistory = true">查看全部 →</button></div><div v-if="history.length" class="recent-list"><button v-for="item in history.slice(0, 5)" :key="item.id" class="history-row" @click="openWorkspace(item.id)"><span class="recent-icon"><FileText :size="18" /></span><span class="recent-title"><strong>{{ item.title }}</strong><small>创建于 {{ formatDate(item.created_at) }}</small></span><span class="recent-action">继续编辑 <ArrowRight :size="15" /></span></button></div><div v-else class="recent-empty"><Clock3 :size="22" /><div><strong>还没有工作记录</strong><p>开始一个教学任务，保存后会显示在这里。</p></div></div></section>
    </section>
